# SGC204 race — concurrent ownership: both fan-out tasks hold `[W]`'s `owns`
# region on `|Doc|` at once. The simulator never blocks on `owns`, so the region
# orders nothing; this is reported, never passed (catalog SGC204). The write is
# declared, so the finding is exact.
# expect: error:13:SGC204
#!spec
(User) -> [Api] : go()
[Api] *> [A] & [B] : run()
[A] -> [W] : save()
[B] -> [W] : save()
|Doc| @write(W)
[W] @owns |Doc| {
  [W] -> |Doc| : put({Doc})
}
